   "extraction": "The page's edge network refuses non-browser clients (HTTP 403), so the raw bytes could not be pinned by digest. Table 1 (Mnemonic, Opcode) was read through a rendering fetcher twice with independent prompts (once in page order with repeats, once as the sorted distinct set); the two distinct sets were compared mechanically and agree exactly (594 mnemonics). The opcode column was read a third time for the ambiguous rows: MOVSD is opcode A5 (the string move), not the SSE scalar move. Re-verify against a browser copy of the page when it is next updated."
  },
